          <span class="block">Houston is back.</span>
          <span class="block">80 spots. One camp.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 font-body text-xl font-semibold text-white/82">{lowSpots ? `Only ${camp.spotsRemaining} spots left.` : "Sold out 2025. Don't wait this time."}</p>
        <a href="#register" class={`${redButtonClass} mt-8 w-full sm:w-auto`}>{ctaLabel}</a>
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-white/78">Questions? Email leejones@jonerfootball.com</p>
      </div>
